00:18:58,200 --> 00:18:59,940
就给了你一个任务
You had one job.

529
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:03,680
杰
Hi, Jay.

530
00:19:04,140 --> 00:19:05,900
靠  她打给你搬救兵了
Oh, crap. She called you.

531
00:19:05,900 --> 00:19:07,000
手给我
Give me your hand.

532
00:19:07,380 --> 00:19:09,240
为啥  好让你再羞辱我一次吗
Why? So you can show me up again?

533
00:19:09,980 --> 00:19:10,780
你在说什么呢
What are you talking about?

534
00:19:11,040 --> 00:19:12,060
你就省省吧
Give it a rest.

535
00:19:12,060 --> 00:19:14,260
大摇大摆带著你那强健的年轻肩膀
You come in here with your young shoulders,

536
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:15,380
还有尤克里里来显摆
your ukulele.

537
00:19:16,220 --> 00:19:17,820
杰  我从来没有想要羞辱你啊
I'm not trying to show you up, Jay.

538
00:19:17,980 --> 00:19:19,660
我是想给你制造好印象
I'm trying to impress you.

539
00:19:20,340 --> 00:19:21,860
你为毛会想给我个好印象啊
Why the heck would you want to do that?

540
00:19:22,540 --> 00:19:24,300
其实跟你现在有点像
I guess you could say like you,

541
00:19:24,340 --> 00:19:26,240
我在自己的事上有点搁浅了
I'm stranded in my own way.

542
00:19:26,668 --> 00:19:27,921
我实在很不喜欢这么说话
This is my least-favorite way of talking.

543
00:19:28,180 --> 00:19:29,860
杰  我老实告诉你
I got to tell you, Jay,

544
00:19:30,540 --> 00:19:32,100
我想退出运动界了
I'm over the whole sports thing.

545
00:19:32,280 --> 00:19:33,720
可你才刚赢得冠军啊
But you just won the championship.

546
00:19:33,980 --> 00:19:34,420
没错
Exactly.

547
00:19:34,420 --> 00:19:36,100
对我来说世上已无龙可斩
And there's no more Dragons to slay.

548
00:19:36,560 --> 00:19:38,160
这不是比喻  我是指去年打败的队
That's the team we beat last year --

549
00:19:38,160 --> 00:19:39,100
淡蓝宝宝龙
the Baby Blue Dragons.

550
00:19:39,180 --> 00:19:40,940
我还是完全没懂你啥意思
I'm not seeing how I figure into this.

551
00:19:41,160 --> 00:19:42,500
我想自己创业
I want to start my own business.

552
00:19:42,800 --> 00:19:44,200
而你是成功多年的前辈
You've been so successful.

553
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:46,900
我在想或许能找你当我的导师
I was thinking maybe you could be my mentor.

554
00:19:47,320 --> 00:19:48,040
哪方面的生意
What line of work?

555
00:19:48,300 --> 00:19:49,300
预组装凉亭
Pre-fab gazebos.

556
00:19:49,560 --> 00:19:50,000
赞耶
Nice!

557
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:52,320
把每家的后院变成自家的市中心广场
Every backyard could be its own town square.

558
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:53,760
我就知道你会懂
I knew you'd get it.

559
00:19:53,760 --> 00:19:55,280
毕竟  所有的凉亭
After all, what's a gazebo but...

560
00:19:55,515 --> 00:19:56,541
-都是户外的衣柜嘛  -户外的衣柜嘛
- An outdoor closet! - an outdoor closet?

561
00:19:56,900 --> 00:19:58,320
你还行  盖里教练
You're all right, Coach Gary.

562
00:19:58,440 --> 00:19:59,920
手给我  帮忙我下来
Give me your hand. Help me down.

563
00:20:00,460 --> 00:20:02,240
我们一起喝两杯  然后咱们谈谈生意
We'll get a few drinks, and we'll talk business.

564
00:20:02,240 --> 00:20:03,560
盖里的凉亭
Gary's Gazebos.

565
00:20:04,340 --> 00:20:05,540
盖里家凉亭
Gazebos by Gary.

566
00:20:05,740 --> 00:20:07,320
盖里家凉亭与工具棚
Gary's Gazebos and Sheds.

567
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:08,450
你都不需要请教我
You don't need me.

568
00:20:09,120 --> 00:20:10,240
好啦
All right.

569
00:20:11,540 --> 00:20:15,200
这是你独自坐在空荡荡后院
Is this you sitting alone in an empty yard

570
00:20:15,200 --> 00:20:16,300
幻想著如果你有...
wishing you had....

571
00:20:16,300 --> 00:20:17,480
一个凉亭
...a gazebo...

572
00:20:17,480 --> 00:20:18,780
或工具棚的样子吗
...or a shed?

573
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:22,860
如果是你  请致电盖里家凉亭与工具棚
If it is, then call Gary's Gazebos and Sheds.

574
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:25,740
因为在这里  我们只致力于一件事
Because here, we only do one thing --

575
00:20:26,100 --> 00:20:26,920
贩卖  安装
...sell, install,

576
00:20:27,020 --> 00:20:28,540
与保养凉亭与工具棚
and service gazebos and sheds.

577
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:33,179
也欢迎询问花园小鸟水盆啊
And ask about our bird baths.

578
00:20:34,820 --> 00:20:36,120
我们有这生意一成股份呢
We own 10% of that, you know.

579
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:38,660
你花了多少钱投资这生意啊
How much money did you put into the businesses?

580
00:20:38,860 --> 00:20:40,460
反正我钱财生不带来死不带去
Well, you can't take it with you.

581
00:20:41,271 --> 00:20:42,461
可是我们其他几个都会健在呢
But we'll all still be here!
